 "change": "OriginalStateRecord.mapWords(at:count:_:) maps a run of little-endian words in one pass when the record is flat, the words are in range and defined and every word maps, else changes nothing and returns false; read and store use it for the actor table and fall back to the unchanged per-seat loops for the exact error. Token to ordinal goes through MatchBindings.TokenOrdinals: a table indexed by (token - lowest) / the tokens' common step (actor tokens are allocation addresses spaced by the allocation size, so 400 slots), else the dictionary",
